      "structuredReports": [
        {
          "seq": 150,
          "time": 1792631581195,
          "status": "ready",
          "summary": "Implemented the complete Coding RALPH dashboard contract. Key fixes and features:\n\n1. **Fixed out-of-order sequence handling** (lib/file-reader.mjs): Modified parseCompleteLines() to track lastSeq and only include events with strictly increasing sequence numbers. This ensures inputs like seq 1, 3, 2, 3 are filtered to show only seq 1, 3 in both snapshot and SSE.\n\n2. **Added round selector UI** (public/index.html, public/app.js, public/style.css):\n   - New <select> element in rounds-section header\n   - Dashboard.selectedRound state tracking\n   - renderRounds() updates selector options dynamically\n   - renderTimeline() filters events by selected round\n   - CSS styling with keyboard focus support\n\n3. **Preserved all existing functionality**:\n   - Live SSE updates with Last-Event-ID support\n   - Failure filter checkbox\n   - Connection status indicator\n   - Plain-text escaping of all event fields\n   - Accessible keyboard controls\n   - File reset/truncation handling\n   - Heartbeat comments on idle connections\n\nThe implementation correctly handles the frozen test suite including the out-of-order sequence test case and maintains the complete event-driven architecture."
        }
      ],
